{"lyrics":"[00:06.86]My life in a nutshell\n[00:12.80]This is my life in a nutshell\n[00:15.54]This is my life in a nutshell, heaven's so far away, I'm startin' to love Hell\n[00:26.08]They know me for my talent, my talent but don't know how my pain feels\n[00:32.64]These prescriptions that I fi-ill, never made the pain heal\n[00:39.38]Fuck, uh, back in the lost and found I go but I'm more lost than found, I know\n[00:47.22]I feel so cold in L.A. like I'm sittin' back at home, Chicago\n[00:53.94]They say living's harder than dyin', I'm willing to gamble that\n[01:00.08]Find me unresponsive in a hotel room, girl, can you handle that?\n[01:06.74]Worst case scenario, you still hear my songs on the stereo\n[01:12.80]You still hear my name on the radio, so I'll live forever, forever\n[01:20.40]This is my life in a nutshell, heaven's so far away, I'm startin' to love Hell\n[01:33.68]They know me for my talent, my talent but don't know how my pain feels\n[01:40.24]These prescriptions that I fi-ill, never made the pain heal\n[01:45.76]Oh-oh-oh, death melodies I sing, cardiac arrest notes\n[02:00.06]I hate to bring the negative vibes in the room  but that's the ugly truth\n[02:07.28]So much of my life and time the world's consumed\n[02:11.76]I throw the deuce and grab the noose, onto the next chapter\n[02:18.70]None of this matters, I've been feelin' helpless\n[02:28.02]This is my life in a nutshell, heaven's so far away, I'm startin' to love Hell\n[02:41.30]They know me for my talent, my talent but don't know how my pain feels\n[02:47.86]These prescriptions that I fi-ill, never made the pain heal","words":[[6.86,6.88,"My"],[8.56,9.9,"life"],[10.08,10.2,"in"],[10.32,10.32,"a"],[10.52,10.92,"nutshell"],[12.8,13.16,"This"],[13.3,13.5,"is"],[13.62,13.82,"my"],[13.86,14.54,"life"],[14.58,14.96,"in"],[15.06,15.06,"a"],[15.1,15.34,"nutshell"],[15.54,15.68,"This"],[15.74,15.76,"is"],[16.0,16.02,"my"],[16.08,16.6,"life"],[16.68,16.78,"in"],[16.84,16.84,"a"],[17.0,17.76,"nutshell,"],